## Governor 9 — Accumulation (operational)

```
Every meaningful change → MEM entry (+ rule file if new law)  
Every verify fail / correction → MEM `type: lesson` + skill-lessons.yaml  
Every wave close       → CEEF + MEM + STATUS + leak-synthesis lesson  
Every substantive turn → LEARN loop per brqosh-continuous-learning.mdc
```

